ok   HashingVectorizer(n_features=16, alternate_sign=False, norm=None): column = |murmurhash3_32(token, seed=0)| mod 16 ('signed 32-bit version of Murmurhash3'), value +1 per occurrence (recomputed with sklearn.utils.murmurhash3_32; collisions summed)  (nnz 16 of 64; collisions 4 docs)
